<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<header class="hiw-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / How Can We Help?</span>
    <h1>Whatever stage you&rsquo;re at, <em>Chayce can help.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">However far along you are &mdash; still deciding, mid-sale, or already holding keys to a new home &mdash; Chayce fits in at that point and takes over from there.</p>
    <a href="/get-started/" class="btn-lg primary">Get Started</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ PATH BAND ============ -->
<section class="path-band">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="cell"><i class="fas fa-map-signs"></i><span class="t">Join at any stage</span><span class="l">Still deciding, mid-sale, or already moved &mdash; we pick up from there</span></div>
    <div class="cell"><i class="fas fa-users"></i><span class="t">For you, or your family</span><span class="l">We work directly with you, or whoever&rsquo;s helping arrange it</span></div>
    <div class="cell"><i class="fas fa-route"></i><span class="t">One clear process</span><span class="l">Four steps, organised around your pace &mdash; not a deadline</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHO WE HELP (sticky editorial) ============ -->
<section class="who-block">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="who-media">
      {% image "hiw2-who-grandparents.jpg", "A senior couple enjoying time together" %}
      <div class="cap">Support for whatever stage you&rsquo;re at</div>
    </div>
    <div class="who-copy">
      <span class="kicker">Who This Is For</span>
      <h2>Support for you, or the <em>people who love you.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">Moving later in life is rarely a one-person job. Chayce works directly with the person moving, and just as often with the son, daughter or family member helping to arrange it &mdash; wherever they happen to be.</p>
      <div class="who-card">
        <h4>If you&rsquo;re the one moving</h4>
        <p>Nothing is rushed and nothing is assumed. We explain each step in plain terms, keep decisions in your hands, and take the physically demanding parts &mdash; sorting, packing, lifting &mdash; off yours.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="text-link dark">Speak to us directly &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="who-card">
        <h4>If you&rsquo;re arranging it for a parent</h4>
        <p>You can start this on their behalf, from anywhere. We keep you both in the loop, coordinate around their pace and preferences, and act as the calm, dependable point of contact you don&rsquo;t have time to be yourself.</p>
        <a href="/get-started/" class="text-link dark">Start on their behalf &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ IMAGE QUOTE BREAK ============ -->
<section class="quote-break">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p>&ldquo;You tell us where you&rsquo;re at. We take over from there &mdash; no rushing, nothing assumed.&rdquo;</p>
    <span class="attr">The Chayce Properties Team</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ THE THREE STAGES (alternating rows) ============ -->
<section class="stages-block">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stages-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker center">The Journey</span>
      <h2>One partner, <em>three stages.</em></h2>
      <p>Rather than a list of services, think of Chayce as support that follows your move through three stages &mdash; preparing, moving, and settling in. You can join at any point.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stage-rows">
      <div class="stage-row reveal">
        <span class="snum">01</span>
        <div class="scopy"><span class="stage-label">Prepare</span><h4>Getting your current home ready</h4><p>Sorting, staging, estate agent liaison and legal coordination &mdash; everything needed to get your current home sold and ready to leave.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-row rev reveal">
        <span class="snum">02</span>
        <div class="scopy"><span class="stage-label">Move</span><h4>Handling moving day, start to finish</h4><p>Packing, insured removals, cleaning and utility transfers &mdash; the physical work of moving, managed so the day itself stays calm.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-row reveal">
        <span class="snum">03</span>
        <div class="scopy"><span class="stage-label">Settle</span><h4>Feeling at home, from day one</h4><p>Furniture placement, unpacking and ongoing concierge support, so your new home feels like yours straight away.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stages-more"><a href="/our-services/" class="text-link dark">See every service in each stage &rarr;</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ THE PROCESS (dark timeline) ============ -->
<section class="process-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker center" style="color:var(--gold-light)">The Process</span>
      <h2>From first call to <em>settled in.</em></h2>
      <p>A clear, four-step process &mdash; organised around your pace, not a deadline.</p>
    </div>
